      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the film completely stretched in machine direction, and transverse direction</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was treated by using methylene chloride at room temperature to remove the diluent, extended up to 150% at 130° C. in the transverse direction, by using heat setting equipment of tenter type, and subjected to shrinking by 20%, compared to a final width in the extension process.</span>
